#X text 689 -68 end is send by the app \, whenever an exit condition
is met \, for example when one leaves the state radius.;
#X text 754 103 when the fadeout is done \, the patcher should be turned
off with switch~ and must send playfinished back to the app in order
set the "busy" flag of the asset to false;
#X obj 646 128 t b b;
#X text 25 -59 play is send by the app when enterconditions are fulfilled
\, for example when the hero enters the state radius.;
#X text 26 44 after receiving the playmessage \, dsp should be turned
on for the patch by using the switch~ object.;
#X text 305 749 send any signal to out1 & out2;
#X obj 557 563 print gain:;
